        "Interpret cortisol's daily rhythm, including its morning surge and nighttime trough, and explain why a single isolated cortisol reading means little without knowing the time it was drawn.",
        "Explain allostatic load as the cumulative cost of a stress response that stays switched on long after the original stressor has passed.",
